  "content": "\n\n<p>這是一個開發者 API，用於為純 Forge 模組添加自定義佔位符外掛，藉此在文字中替換佔位符。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如需更多協助，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Pixelmon-Development/AdvancedHolograms/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>&nbsp;或加入我的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/7vqgtrjDGw\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如需指令資訊，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Pixelmon-Development/AdvancedHolograms/wiki/Commands-&-Permissions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">指令與權限</a>&nbsp;頁面。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如需開發者資訊，請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Daniel-Forge-Development/ForgePlaceholderAPI/wiki/Creating-Custom-Placeholders\" rel=\"nofollow\">開發者</a> 頁面。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>隨著模組更新，Wiki 將持續新增更多資訊以維持最新版本。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/831966641586831431/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"\" width=\"371\" height=\"88\"></p>",
